   "module_16121289240844": {
    "body": {
     "hs_enable_module_padding": true,
     "hs_wrapper_css": {
      "padding-bottom": "10px",
      "padding-left": "20px",
      "padding-right": "20px",
      "padding-top": "10px"
     },
     "html": "<p><strong>Key Steps For Starting Your Private Label Supplement Practice:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Evaluate your market</li>\n<li>Research and choose a high-quality supplier</li>\n<li>Learn which products will do well</li>\n<li>Create your brand and label</li>\n</ul>\n<p>These are four of the seven steps for successfully embarking on a private label supplement business, each detailed out so you can quickly create your checklist and be well on your way to maximizing your revenue.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Click the button below to take advantage of this amazing, free content and learn how to start a successful private label business with seven simple steps!&nbsp;</p>",
     "module_id": 1155639
    },
    "child_css": {},
    "css": {},
    "id": "module_16121289240844",
    "label": null,
    "module_id": 1155639,
    "name": "module_16121289240844",
    "order": 13,
