    "styles": {},
    "type": "module"
   },
   "module_16123736011481": {
    "body": {
     "hs_enable_module_padding": true,
     "hs_wrapper_css": {
      "padding-bottom": "10px",
      "padding-left": "20px",
      "padding-right": "20px",
      "padding-top": "10px"
     },
     "html": "<p>Hi&nbsp;{{ contact.firstname }},</p>\n<p>When done correctly, starting a private label supplement business can launch your revenue to the next level.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Whether you start with just a few select products or an entire line, private label supplements with <span style=\"background:#FFF3CD;border-bottom:2px solid #8A6300;\" data-praxera-review=\"brand\">Praxera</span> ensure your customers get professional-grade supplements that you can easily sell, without the risk of sitting on inventory.</p>\n<p><br>It's a win-win for everyone.</p>",
     "module_id": 1155639
